%%{init: {"look": "classic", "fontFamily": "arial, sans-serif"}}%%
flowchart TD
    setup([Prepare the environment]) --> aap{AAP already running?}
    aap -- yes --> inv[Build inventory, validate the environment]
    aap -- no --> deploy[Deploy AAP on OpenShift<br/>one of the last laptop CLI steps]
    deploy --> inv
    inv --> seed[Seed AAP from the laptop<br/>the last required laptop run]
    seed --> done([After seed: providers, maps, and waves<br/>run from AAP job templates])
    classDef laptop fill:#ffffff,stroke:#ee0000,stroke-width:1.5px;
    class deploy,seed laptop
